  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Pantheon of Woe",
    "summary": "Enemy units within 6\" of any **NECRONS MONSTER** unit in your army are unravelling, and attacks on an unravelling unit have 1 better Armour Penetration; this is each such unit's **Distortion Fields (Aura)** ability.\n\nAs each phase begins, you may inflict 3 **mortal wounds** on any number of those units; each unit that takes them has a 9\" Distortion Fields (Aura) range until that phase ends.\n\nThe Necrodermal Binding Abilities each fit only certain models:\n\n- [Singularity Matrix](vsdata:ability/necrons.pantheon-of-woe.singularity-matrix): **C’TAN SHARD OF THE DECEIVER** only, granting **Lord of Deceit (Aura)**\n- [Quantum Goad](vsdata:ability/necrons.pantheon-of-woe.quantum-goad): **C’TAN SHARD OF THE NIGHTBRINGER** only\n- [Animus Damper](vsdata:ability/necrons.pantheon-of-woe.animus-damper): **C’TAN SHARD OF THE VOID DRAGON** only\n- [Reletavistic Tether](vsdata:ability/necrons.pantheon-of-woe.reletavistic-tether): **TRANSCENDENT C’TAN** only\n\nAn army with 2 or more **TRANSCENDENT C’TAN** units must give each of them [Reletavistic Tether](vsdata:ability/necrons.pantheon-of-woe.reletavistic-tether).",
